t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af52E5PXAy3cFH5p1PsHP89BG_4e93JfvJJkz1yMT-i3qg&oe=6A203F3E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Infinifly Landscape.png", "id": "1506564884028020", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308307_1506564894028019_4682726019528801279_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FiYpsViJCU8Q7kNvwHxmbCf&_nc_oc=AdrSN8ujEgRBqxklAslsb3G0GGZlGhejYoYzIC2N3lmtQCgtEnyxByFeHHBnhECvCpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5UBU6wt3N1P2wTfwnJ8EV6xLkqL_YPNh0hIoPHCLk10g&oe=6A20448B"}, "display_name": "Infinifly", "keywords": ["infinite", "leaderboard", "tunnel", "fast", "challenge"], "long_description": "# How far can you go?\n\nInfinifly is a fast-paced VR arcade experience set inside an endless tunnel where your only goal is simple\u2026 survive as long as possible!\n\nDodge obstacles with lightning reflexes, face increasing speed and challenge yourself in a game that needs precision and focus.\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Modes:\n\nFlow Mode:  Move and dodge in every direction to navigate through complex patterns.\n\nRacer Mode: High-speed thrill where you focus on lateral dodging. \n\nXR Mode: Play in Mixed Reality within your own room. You decide how to survive: dodge physically with your head for a full-body workout or use either hand for a more relaxed but precise control scheme.\n\n# \ud83d\udca1Highlights:\n\n\ud83c\udf9a Multiple difficulties \u2013 from easy to hard, tailor the challenge to your skills.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 Unlockable checkpoints \u2013 progress further and unlock new starting points to jump right back into the action.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Online leaderboards \u2013 compete globally with dedicated rankings for each checkpoint and difficulty.\n\n\u26a1 Dynamic gameplay \u2013 increasing speed, tight passages, and complex obstacles make every run unique.\n\n# \ud83c\udfa8 Customize:\n\nCustomize your experience: change the environment and the obstacles, going from meadows and beaches to space ships and abstract spaces\n\n# \ud83d\udd01 Perfect for:\n\nTraining your reflexes\nPlayers who love quick and intense challenges\nCompetitive gamers chasing the top spot\nCasual players looking for a fast but engaging VR experience", "short_description": "How far can you go?\n\nInfinifly is a fast-paced VR arcade experience set inside an endless tunnel where your only goal is simple\u2026 survive as long as possible!\n\nDodge obstacles with lightning reflexes, face increasing speed and challenge yourself in a game that needs precision and focus.\n\nHighlights: \nMultiple difficulties to tailor the challenge to your skills.\nUnlockable checkpoints  to jump right back into the action\nOnline leaderboards to compete globally\nDifferent environments"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/RavensRose/Infinifly/blob/main/Privacy%20Policy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ravensrose.github.io/Infinifly/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27444796008541392"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831276_4100174753603792_5715338011694347615_n